+# Patent Research, Drafting & Editing
+
+> An integrated workspace + toolchain for patent **prior-art search / novelty self-check / search evidence chain / drafting assistance**.
+> Three deliverables: the **skill package** (for AI clients), the **`patentkit` core** (pip package), and the **workspace data** (private, local).
+
+**Current versions**: skill package [`skill-v2.3.0`](https://github.com/cyy1018abc-kyy/Patent-Research-and-Drafting-and-Editing-/releases/tag/skill-v2.3.0) ·
+core [`patentkit-v0.1.1`](https://github.com/cyy1018abc-kyy/Patent-Research-and-Drafting-and-Editing-/releases/tag/patentkit-v0.1.1)
+(see [`CHANGELOG.md`](CHANGELOG.md) for changes)
+
+## Quick start (pick the row for your role)
+
+| I want to… | Start here |
+|---|---|
+| **Use the skill for patent research / self-checks** (Claude Code / Codex CLI / Codex desktop) | Download the [skill package release](https://github.com/cyy1018abc-kyy/Patent-Research-and-Drafting-and-Editing-/releases/tag/skill-v2.3.0) → install per [`patent-research-skill/README.md`](patent-research-skill/README.md) |
+| **Develop / extend the core** | `pip install -e ".[mcp,dev]"` → `python -m pytest` → [`patentkit/`](patentkit/) |
+| **Work in this workspace** (search / comparison / gates / delivery) | `cd` to the repo root (where `workspace.yml` lives) → follow [`docs/operations_manual.md`](docs/operations_manual.md) |
